    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<i>From my commanding perch atop an ant hill, I, the malevolent mantis, control a powerful UFO, snatching ants with sinister glee. The queen by my side, we share an unyielding mission: total eradication of the antlions. Little do you know, there are eight formidable waves of ants I've summoned. Worker ants, fire ants, ghost ants, electric ants, pharaoh ants, mummy ants, dinosaur ants, and relentless army ants\u2014each more formidable than the last. But wait, there's more! In this battle for dominance, you'll encounter treasure beyond imagination. Gold, arrows, bombs, potions, armor\u2014upgrades that promise to grant you the power to face the entire ant army. However, don't be deluded by your puny dreams of triumph. The road ahead is treacherous, and the odds are stacked against you. Brace yourself for your inevitable downfall, as my malevolence remains unchallenged, and the ants tremble before our wrath.</i><br><br><strong>Use ANY of the following Controls:</strong><br>Shoot: 1, H, J, SHIFT LEFT, SHIFT RIGHT, NUMPAD1, NUMPAD4<br>Roar: 2, Y, U<br>Potion: 3, T, I, BACKSLASH, NUMPAD2, NUMPAD8<br>Bomb: 4, F, L, NUMPAD3, NUMPAD6<br>Run: LEFT ARROW, RIGHT ARROW, A, D<br>Jump: SPACE, UP ARROW, W, G, K, NUMPAD0, NUMPAD5<br>Select: MOUSE<br>Pause/Retry: ESC<br>Mute: M",
    "about_the_game": "<i>From my commanding perch atop an ant hill, I, the malevolent mantis, control a powerful UFO, snatching ants with sinister glee. The queen by my side, we share an unyielding mission: total eradication of the antlions. Little do you know, there are eight formidable waves of ants I've summoned. Worker ants, fire ants, ghost ants, electric ants, pharaoh ants, mummy ants, dinosaur ants, and relentless army ants\u2014each more formidable than the last. But wait, there's more! In this battle for dominance, you'll encounter treasure beyond imagination. Gold, arrows, bombs, potions, armor\u2014upgrades that promise to grant you the power to face the entire ant army. However, don't be deluded by your puny dreams of triumph. The road ahead is treacherous, and the odds are stacked against you. Brace yourself for your inevitable downfall, as my malevolence remains unchallenged, and the ants tremble before our wrath.</i><br><br><strong>Use ANY of the following Controls:</strong><br>Shoot: 1, H, J, SHIFT LEFT, SHIFT RIGHT, NUMPAD1, NUMPAD4<br>Roar: 2, Y, U<br>Potion: 3, T, I, BACKSLASH, NUMPAD2, NUMPAD8<br>Bomb: 4, F, L, NUMPAD3, NUMPAD6<br>Run: LEFT ARROW, RIGHT ARROW, A, D<br>Jump: SPACE, UP ARROW, W, G, K, NUMPAD0, NUMPAD5<br>Select: MOUSE<br>Pause/Retry: ESC<br>Mute: M",
    "short_description": "On an ant hill far away, a malevolent mantis commands a UFO, abducting ants. With the queen by his side, their mission: wipe out antlions once and for all. You, the last hope, must outsmart the mantis, protect your kin, and ensure survival. The fate of antlions hangs in the balance.",
    "supported_languages": "English",
